==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns.
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns.
*Infinite [[Duche]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 33.33~53.33 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]] is tanky enough to get some damage off of Master A. Use [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cats]] with a long-ranged attacker like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] to wear down the Duches, or spammable [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cats]] such as [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Rocker Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]].

