==Trivia==
*Going along with the "risqué" theme of [[Risqué Terrain]], Shapely Caverns' Japanese name is ''Sekushī Shōnyūdo'' (セクシー鍾乳洞), or "Sexy Limestone Cave". If you take out the ''nyūdo'', it also sounds like "Sexy Show".

